      <link>https://www.wyomingpublicmedia.org/natural-resources-energy/2026-02-10/chemtrail-legislation-ban-is-nixed-while-cloud-seeding-funding-moves-forward</link>
      <description>Legislation based around “chemtrail” conspiracy theories was killed by lawmakers, although there’s still a narrow window for it to resurface. Meanwhile, the state's approval for cloud seeding, which is at the root of the conspiracies, is moving forward.</description>
